# The PulseTrack raw extracts are distributed exactly as the generator
# produced them and as the QA scripts validated them. The CSVs are
# uniformly CRLF and the JSONL/stream files uniformly LF; git's autocrlf
# handling would rewrite the CSVs to LF on commit. Mark the raw source
# files as non-text so their bytes survive the round trip untouched.
DE01Capstone/data/*.csv     -text
DE01Capstone/mongo/*.jsonl  -text
DE01Capstone/stream/*.log   -text
